LuckyTalk Bot – Privacy Policy

Last Updated: May 20, 2026

Thank you for using LuckyTalk. This Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, why we collect it, and how we use it.

By using LuckyTalk, you agree to this Privacy Policy.


---

1. Information We Collect

LuckyTalk only collects the minimum data required for its functionality:

User IDs – used to manage active chat sessions (/talk feature)

Server IDs – used to store server-specific settings (such as enabled/disabled commands)

Temporary Message Context – up to the last 10 messages in a conversation, used only to generate relevant AI responses


We do not collect passwords, emails, or any personal information outside of Discord.


---

2. How We Use Your Data

The data collected is used only for:

Providing conversation features

Improving response relevance (AI context)

Saving server preferences (like command settings)


We do not use your data for advertising, marketing, or profiling.


---

3. Data Storage & Retention

Message context is temporary and is not permanently stored.

User session data is removed when you use /stoptalk or restart the bot.

Server settings remain stored until changed or the bot is removed from the server.


We do not maintain long-term chat logs.


---

4. Data Sharing

We do not sell, trade, or share your data with third parties.

However, limited data may be processed by third-party services required for:

AI response generation

Image generation features


These services only process data temporarily and do not store it for us.


---

5. Data Security

We take reasonable steps to protect stored data. However:

No system is 100% secure

You use the bot at your own risk



---

6. Your Control Over Data

You have control over your data:

Use /stoptalk to end sessions and clear active context

Leave servers to remove server-specific data association

Contact support if you want data clarification or removal



---

7. Third-Party Services

LuckyTalk may rely on external APIs (such as AI or image generation providers). These services may process your input temporarily to generate responses.

We are not responsible for their policies or uptime.


---

8. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy occasionally. Updates will be reflected by the "Last Updated" date above.

Continued use of LuckyTalk means you accept any changes.


---

9. Contact

If you have questions or concerns about your privacy, please contact us via our official support server.
